307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/E (This guide consolidates, in one place, the labor-compliance responsibilities that fall on managers overseeing employees in Mexico. It brings together previously scattered policies, FAQs, and job aids into a single, easy-to-navigate reference and serves as the primary resource for day-to-day people decisions involving Mexico-based employees.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
