323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (In the United States, an employer can generally end employment for any lawful reason. That concept does not exist in Mexico. While an employer may decide to end an employment relationship without a legally recognized cause, doing so generally results in an unjustified dismissal and requires payment of the applicable statutory severance. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
