<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (This chapter is the foundation for Chapter 6. In Mexico, the ability to part ways with an underperforming or misbehaving employee without paying full severance depends almost entirely on documentation that you, as a manager, create over time. The trail must exist before any termination is contemplated.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
