/E (Documentation alone does not automatically create legal cause for termination under Mexican labor law. Performance documentation is an important tool for business decision-making, consistency, and risk management, but poor performance by itself may not always support a with-cause separation. Depending on the circumstances, performance-related separations may require a negotiated exit strategy and close coordination with Employee Relations, HR, and Legal.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [14]
